WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:08.470
This is Tidy, a small task list. Here is how to add a task, and say how urgent it is.

00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:12.130
Type what needs doing in the box at the top.

00:00:12.580 --> 00:00:17.670
Choose its priority from the menu beside it. This one is High.

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:24.850
Then click Add task. It joins the list, with its priority on the right.

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:30.750
Add the next one the same way. The counter shows how many tasks are still open.
